Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 23:37:09 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] kk: Add MESA_KK_LIGHT_BARRIERS

Every encoder ends with a barrier on all stages, which keeps
consecutive render passes from overlapping. With MESA_KK_LIGHT_BARRIERS
set, render encoders end without it; the barriers and event waits the
application records, render pass splits and query availability writes
make the next encoder wait for all prior work instead. Compute
encoders, which carry the passes feeding draws, keep the barrier.

Off by default until measured in games.

Generated-by: LLM
